<title>USA: Lyondell says refinery at full ops rates.</title>
<headline>Lyondell says refinery at full ops rates.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lyondell Petrochemical Co said Thursday the Houston-based refinery it co-owns with CITGO Petroleum Corp has been at full operating rates since July 26, processing 230,000 barrels of heavy crude oil per day under its contract agreement with Venezuela.</p>
<p>Lyondell is comfortable with analyst range estimates averaging $0.87 per share for the third quarter ending September 30, as reported by First Call, it said.</p>
<p>The company said it believes estimates includes the impact of downtime at the refinery for maintenance during early July.</p>
</text>
